<h2>Welcome to <%= franchise.franchiseName %>!</h2>

<p>Dear <%= memberName %>,</p>

<p>We're thrilled to have you join the <%= franchise.franchiseName %> family! Your account has been successfully created.</p>

<p>You can now access your account and start your journey towards a healthier lifestyle.</p>

<% if (loginUrl) { %>
<p>
  <a href="<%= loginUrl %>" style="display: inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; background-color: <%= franchise.brandColor || '#4CAF50' %>; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; margin: 20px 0;">
    Login to Your Account
  </a>
</p>
<% } %>

<p>If you have any questions or need assistance, please don't hesitate to contact our support team at <a href="mailto:<%= franchise.supportEmail %>"><%= franchise.supportEmail %></a>.</p>

<p>Best regards,<br>The <%= franchise.franchiseName %> Team</p>

